    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The Chef tastes the pâté that Maks prepared. Maks is waiting for a compliment. Let us see what happens next in this scene. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'not bad' and 'only' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
